<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层演变</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>Loop 管时间上的反馈</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#A32D2D", lineHeight: 1.0}}>反</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 16}}>没有门禁的 loop</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "#A32D2D", marginTop: 8}}>只会更快地放大错误。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.05)", borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: "3px solid #1C1F23"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>loop &#123;</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 12}}>act() 　# 触发<br />verify() 　# 验证<br />if !pass: retry() 　# 停止条件<br />remember() 　# 记忆<br />&#125;</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>黄金法则：上次结果不改变下次行动，那叫重试，不叫 loop。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>09 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
